{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Champions City</strong> is a fresh and modern <strong>life simulation game</strong> focused on climbing the social ladder, stepping into a luxurious lifestyle, and building your influence in a living, breathing city.<br>Create your character, manage your daily routine, grow your social media presence, increase your wealth, and become one of the most influential figures in the city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfaf Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rise through the city:</strong> Meet celebrities, connect with new people, expand your social circle, and gain popularity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Finder, Kisstagram &amp; Camera apps:</strong> Message people, share stories, build relationships, and shape your social life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A vibrant city atmosphere:</strong> Clothing stores, tech shops, car dealerships, street events, and various interactive locations bring the city to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic city activities:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udccb <strong>Survey Tasks:</strong> Earn quick income by completing simple surveys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26cf\ufe0f <strong>Mining:</strong> Upgrade your hardware and generate higher income through a modern mining system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uded2 <strong>PC Store:</strong> Browse and purchase new PC parts, tech devices, and upgrades to improve your lifestyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Car Store:</strong> Discover different vehicles, compare stats, and pick the ride that fits your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd10 <strong>Parrola (Code Cracking):</strong> Solve attention-based mini challenges to earn extra rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbc <strong>City Jobs:</strong> Take on small tasks, daily jobs, and side activities to earn money, popularity, and experience.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate your home:</strong> Move, rotate, and freely place furniture with a flexible placement system\u2014make your home truly yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop your lifestyle:</strong> Go shopping, create outfits, build your image, and express your character\u2019s identity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend into the rhythm of the city, build your new life, and <strong>rise to the top of Champions City!</strong> \ud83c\udf06\ud83d\udcab\ud83d\udd25</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3451040?t=1770490616","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451040/d42be0b5d5732973a12d18fff127d7682333c0e6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770490616","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451040/2151ce87a112bb25e93bbd13cf3f2b5be3510c8a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770490616","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451040/2151ce87a112bb25e93bbd13cf3f2b5be3510c8a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770490616","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Champions City</strong> is a fresh and modern <strong>life simulation game</strong> focused on climbing the social ladder, stepping into a 